{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"You find a ruler on the desk. Pupils want to make a sound with it. What do you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Hold it on the edge of the desk and flick the end","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Hold it still and tap the desk with it","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"The ruler shakes quickly and makes a buzzing sound. The ruler is vibrating!"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"The tap makes a short knock, but the ruler stays still. Try flicking the end to hear a buzz."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
